OL,4,CSouth Africa's Ramaphosa wins court    
OL,5,Cbattle over impeachment threat         
OL,6,GSouth African President Cyril          
OL,7,GRamaphosa has won a legal battle to    
OL,8,Goverturn a report that found he may    
OL,9,Ghave a case to answer over the theft   
OL,10,Gof large sums of cash from his private 
OL,11,Gfarm.                                  
OL,13,FIn 2022, an independent panel said     
OL,14,FRamaphosa may have committed serious   
OL,15,Fmisconduct relating to the theft of    
OL,16,F$580,000 (#443,000), hidden in a sofa, 
OL,17,Fat his Phala Phala game farm in the    
OL,18,FLimpopo province. He denied any        
OL,19,Fwrongdoing.                            
